---
// Step 3: a page builds itself line by line, then goes live.
---

<div class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center px-6">
  <div class="ill-tile w-full max-w-[13rem] p-4">
    <div class="ill-line ill-build w-2/5"></div>
    <div class="ill-line ill-build mt-3 w-full" style="animation-delay: 0.3s"></div>
    <div class="ill-line ill-build mt-2 w-4/5" style="animation-delay: 0.6s"></div>
    <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="ill-pop h-6 w-20 rounded-control bg-accent" style="animation-delay: 0.9s"></div>
      <span class="type-caption ill-pop flex items-center gap-1.5 text-success" style="animation-delay: 1.2s">
        <span class="anim-pulse size-1.5 rounded-full bg-success"></span> Live
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
